:"泰始八年诏拜郤正巴西太守","evidence":["duzhou-q-bb3ed6b7335eee3e95e3"]},{"id":"duzhou-a-4ae077d7ef47d6dca954","label":"裴注·泰始八年诏","text":"泰始八年诏拜郤正巴西太守","evidence":["duzhou-q-7d33519aa206aaaae3a3"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houzhu-p0019","role":"泰始八年诏称其昔在成都颠沛守义不违忠节，及见受用尽心干事有治理之绩，以之为巴西太守","evidence":["duzhou-q-bb3ed6b7335eee3e95e3","duzhou-q-7d33519aa206aaaae3a3"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["duzhou-q-bb3ed6b7335eee3e95e3","duzhou-q-7d33519aa206aaaae3a3"]},"ordering_evidence":"duzhou-q-bb3ed6b7335eee3e95e3","source_order":[42,582,22],"order":7580},{"id":"duzhou-e-o111","title":"郤正咸宁四年卒","accounts":[{"id":"duzhou-a-25f919288ccddd523942","label":"正文","text":"郤正咸宁四年卒","evidence":["duzhou-q-a062b6f53bf519cea4a2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houzhu-p0019","role":"咸宁四年卒","evidence":["duzhou-q-a062b6f53bf519cea4a2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["duzhou-q-a062b6f53bf519cea4a2"]},"ordering_evidence":"duzhou-q-a062b6f53bf519cea4a2","source_order":[42,582,74],"order":7581}],"persons":[{"id":"houzhu-p0019","name":"郤正","evidence":["houzhu-q-O085","jfj-q0208","jfj-q0251","jfj-q0252","duzhou-q-896e9fc28382dc9000da","duzhou-q-9bd7966e3bd0e5179d2e","duzhou-q-3b9f7be8cfe87c04d56b","duzhou-q-96b300155ce79a731924","duzhou-q-3e79261917b90578efcf","duzhou-q-fe39aeda0247f8516310","duzhou-q-7fb55da345f72104b37c","duzhou-q-56e3f9e0229c3f4a567f","duzhou-q-bb3ed6b7335eee3e95e3","duzhou-q-a062b6f53bf519cea4a2","duzhou-q-7d33519aa206aaaae3a3","duzhou-q-a3b847730fd0f1bef8ae"],"facts":[{"id":"duzhou-f2-1a5423b0746b98ecb230","text":"郤正本名纂，少以父死母嫁，单茕只立；入为秘书吏，转令史，迁郎，至令。","evidence":["duzhou-q-a3b847730fd0f1bef8ae"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"houzhu-m-houzhu-q-O085-houzhu-p0019","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houzhu-q-O085"]},{"id":"houzhu-m-houzhu-q-P087-houzhu-p0019","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houzhu-q-P087"]},{"id":"houzhu-m-houzhu-q-P087a-houzhu-p0019","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houzhu-q-P087a"]},{"id":"jfj-m-o056-houzhu-p0019","kind":"mention","text":"评述或文中涉及：郤正","evidence":["jfj-q0208"]},{"id":"jfj-m-p022-houzhu-p0019","kind":"mention","text":"评述或文中涉及：郤正","evidence":["jfj-q0251"]},{"id":"jfj-m-p023-houzhu-p0019","kind":"mention","text":"评述或文中涉及：郤正","evidence":["jfj-q0252"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"duzhou-q-114a86b286c37d9f8c12","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-34330cdc65ead9972c12","layer":"original","quote":"今天纲已缀〖18〗，德树西邻〖19〗；丕显祖之宏规〖20〗，縻好爵于士人〖21〗；兴五教以训俗〖22〗，丰九德以济民〖23〗；肃明祀以礿祭〖24〗，几皇道以辅真。虽峙者未一〖25〗，伪者未分；圣人垂戒，盖均无贫；故君臣协美于朝，黎庶欣戴于野〖26〗；动若重规〖27〗，静若叠矩。济济伟彦，元凯之伦也〖28〗；有过必知，颜子之仁也〖29〗；侃侃庶政〖30〗，冉、季之治也〖31〗，鹰扬鸷腾〖32〗，伊、望之事也〖33〗。总群俊之上略，含薛氏之三计〖34〗；敷张、陈之秘策〖35〗，故力征以勤世；援华英而不遑〖36〗，岂暇修枯箨于榛秽哉〖37〗！","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":472,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":271,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-12388287ff5e21d9739f","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-33f3aa048ccbd7458fe7","layer":"original","quote":"狭屈氏之常醒〖13〗，浊渔父之必醉；溷柳季之卑辱〖14〗，褊夷、叔之高怼〖15〗。合不以得〖16〗，违不以失；得不充诎〖17〗，失不惨悸；不乐前以顾轩〖18〗，不就后以虑轾〖19〗；不鬻誉以干泽，不辞愆以忌黜〖20〗。何责之释？何餐之恤？何方之排？何直之入？九考不移，固其所执也！﹝一﹞","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":512,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-178507ad62e769e5846b","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-3d45e522d16e992ebfe7","layer":"original","quote":"景耀六年，后主从谯周之计，遣使请降于邓艾","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":579,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-1823a64d556b9b0453c0","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-79fdfc5da3a61b2db159","layer":"original","quote":"余闻而叹曰：‘呜呼，有若云乎邪〖36〗？夫人心不同，实若其面〖37〗；子虽光丽，既美且艳；管窥筐举〖38〗，守厥所见；未可以言八纮之形埒〖39〗，信","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":385,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-20593ea703da97057362","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-693582ec6ad2f882f698","layer":"original","quote":"昔九方考精于至贵〖42〗，秦牙沉思于殊形〖43〗；﹝三﹞薛烛察宝以飞誉〖44〗，﹝四﹞瓠梁托弦以流声〖45〗；﹝五﹞齐隶拊髀以济文〖46〗，﹝六﹞楚客潜寇以保荆〖47〗；﹝七﹞雍门援琴而挟说，﹝八﹞韩哀秉辔而驰名〖48〗；﹝九﹞卢敖翱翔乎玄阙〖49〗，﹝十﹞若士竦身于云清〖50〗：余实不能齐技于数子〖51〗，故乃静然守己而自宁。’”","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":515,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":167,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-21ae0160b98a708fab66","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-50bfd779884061dc9a0c","layer":"original","quote":"辞穷路殚，将反初节〖30〗；综坟典之流芳〖31〗，寻孔氏之遗艺〖32〗；缀微辞以存道〖33〗，宪先轨而投制〖34〗；韪叔肸之优游〖35〗，美疏氏之遐逝〖36〗；收止足以言归〖37〗，泛皓然以容裔〖38〗；欣环堵以恬娱〖39〗，免咎悔于斯世；顾兹心之未泰〖40〗，惧末途之泥滞；仍求激而增愤，肆中怀以告誓〖41〗。","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":514,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-304ce4773010397a5961","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-68dd3d19d6456b42b287","layer":"original","quote":"群臣或难周曰：“今艾已不远，恐不受降，如之何？”周曰：“方今东吴未宾〖13〗，事势不得不受之；受之后，不得不礼。若陛下降魏，魏不裂土以封陛下者〖14〗，周请身诣京都，以古义争之！”众人无以易周之理","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":299,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-3b9f7be8cfe87c04d56b","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-5e754a66b65a0d22ce89","layer":"original","quote":"自在内职〖12〗，与宦人黄皓比屋周旋〖13〗，经三十年。皓从微至贵，操弄威权；正既不为皓所爱，亦不为皓所憎。是以官不过六百石〖14〗，而免于忧患","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-3e79261917b90578efcf","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-3d45e522d16e992ebfe7","layer":"original","quote":"其书，正所造也","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":579,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-41c437ed6248c17bf075","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-9f5771338709a8e53422","layer":"original","quote":"于是遂从周策。刘氏无虞〖33〗，一邦蒙赖：周之谋也","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":301,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-4866ceaa6aacd666bb63","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-f1e0524442057229c3d8","layer":"original","quote":"后主犹疑于入南〖15〗，周上疏曰：“或说陛下以北兵深入，有欲适南之计，臣愚以为不安","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-48d715a555fb5c2d2859","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-3ac98c7278819794c208","layer":"original","quote":"夫何故哉？利回其心〖24〗，宠耀其目；赫赫龙章〖25〗，铄铄车服〖26〗；偷幸苟得〖27〗，如反如仄〖28〗；淫邪荒迷，恣睢自极〖29〗；和鸾未调而身在辕侧〖30〗，庭宁未践而栋折榱覆〖31〗。天收其精，地缩其泽；人吊其躬〖32〗，鬼芟其额〖33〗。初升高冈，终陨幽壑；朝含荣润，夕为枯魄。是以贤人君子，深图远虑；畏彼咎戾〖34〗，超然高举〖35〗；宁曳尾于涂中〖36〗，秽浊世之休誉〖37〗。彼岂轻主慢民，而忽于时务哉？盖《易》著行止之戒〖38〗，《诗》有靖恭之叹〖39〗：乃神之听之，而道使之然也。","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":429,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":251,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-4e827542b8e82940ce6f","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-9a87d2041e499d8b5b04","layer":"original","quote":"惟周以为：“自古以来，无寄他国为天子者也。今若入吴，固当臣服。且政理不殊〖6〗，则大能吞小，此数之自然也。由此言之，则魏能并吴，吴不能并魏，明矣。（等为小称臣，孰与为大）〔等为称臣〖7〗，为小孰与为大〖8〗〕？再辱之耻〖9〗，何与一辱？且若欲奔南，则当早为之计，然后可果〖10〗。今大敌已近，祸败将及；群小之心〖11〗，无一可保；恐发足之日〖12〗，其变不测：何至南之有乎","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":61,"end":247,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-56e3f9e0229c3f4a567f","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-4ab9a42c1dd0d6494977","layer":"original","quote":"泰始中，除安阳令〖4〗，迁巴西太守","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":581,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-62dbf1666e07388d3813","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-9e0b3ad7d01ef804b5fb","layer":"original","quote":"昔在鸿荒〖5〗，蒙昧肇初〖6〗；三皇应箓〖7〗，五帝承符。爰暨夏、商〖8〗，前典攸书〖9〗；姬衰道缺〖10〗，霸者翼扶〖11〗。嬴氏惨虐〖12〗，吞嚼八区〖13〗：于是从横云起，狙诈如星〖14〗；奇邪蜂动〖15〗，智故萌生；或饰真以雠伪〖16〗，或挟邪以干荣〖17〗；或诡道以要上〖18〗，或鬻技以自矜〖19〗；背正崇邪，弃直就佞；忠无定分，义无常经：故鞅法究而慝作〖20〗，斯义败而奸成〖21〗；吕门大而宗灭〖22〗，韩辩立而身刑〖23〗。","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":428,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":221,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-6959375f86f0ed317bd7","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-2d2b365b0087a7119f73","layer":"original","quote":"或人率尔〖1〗，仰而扬衡曰〖2〗：‘是何言与！是何言与！’余应之曰：‘虞帝以面从为戒〖3〗，孔圣以悦己为尤〖4〗；若子之言，良我所思，将为吾子论而释之：","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":427,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-69e7d859a0b1727b453e","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-3344f634cda0e67ebdd4","layer":"original","quote":"然而道有隆窳〖7〗，物有兴废；有声有寂，有光有翳〖8〗；朱阳否于素秋〖9〗，玄阴抑于孟春〖10〗；羲和逝而望舒系〖11〗，运气匿而耀灵陈〖12〗。冲、质不永〖13〗，桓、灵坠败〖14〗；英雄云布，豪杰盖世；家挟殊议〖15〗，人怀异计；故从横者歘披其胸〖16〗，狙诈者暂吐其舌也〖17〗。","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-7d33519aa206aaaae3a3","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-3850429b99c6a70acfcc","layer":"pei","quote":"泰始八年诏曰：“正，昔在成都，颠沛守义，不违忠节；及见受用，尽心干事，有治理之绩。其以正为巴西太守","attribution":"裴注·泰始八年诏","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":588,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7a1e60bf3efaf293e990","start":3,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-7dd80f12a80a4e32e2f9","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-9a87d2041e499d8b5b04","layer":"original","quote":"后主使群臣会议，计无所出。或以为“蜀之与吴，本为和国，宜可奔吴”；或以为“南中七郡，阻险斗绝〖5〗，易以自守，宜可奔南","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":298,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-7fb55da345f72104b37c","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-63b42641a680eadddce4","layer":"original","quote":"时论嘉之。赐爵关内侯","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":580,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":88,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-81cbf4172b0242351c82","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-3593a75a3fcc34fb962a","layer":"original","quote":"“或有讥余者曰：‘闻之前记：“夫事与时并，名与功偕。”然则名之与事，前哲之急务也。是故创制作范，匪时不立〖4〗；流称垂名，匪功不记〖5〗。名必须功而乃显〖6〗，事亦俟时以行止；身没名灭，君子所耻。是以达人研道〖7〗，探赜索微〖8〗；观天运之符表〖9〗，考人事之盛衰；辩者驰说〖10〗，智者应机〖11〗；谋夫演略，武士奋威；云合雾集，风激电飞；量时揆宜〖12〗，用取世资〖13〗；小屈大申，存公忽私；虽尺枉而寻直〖14〗，终扬光以发辉也！今三方鼎峙，九有未乂〖15〗；悠悠四海，婴丁祸败〖16〗；嗟道义之沉塞，愍生民之颠沛；此诚圣贤拯救之秋，烈士树功之会也。吾子以高朗之才，珪璋之质〖17〗；兼览博窥，留心道术〖18〗；无远不致，无幽不悉；挺身取命〖19〗，干兹奥秘〖20〗；踌躇紫闼〖21〗，喉舌是执〖22〗；九考不移〖23〗，有入无出；〔一〕究古今之真伪，计时务之得失。虽时献一策，偶进一言；释彼官责〖24〗，慰此素餐〖25〗；固未能输竭忠款〖26〗，尽沥胸肝，排方入直〖27〗，惠彼黎元〖28〗：俾吾徒草鄙〖29〗，并有闻焉也！盍亦绥衡缓辔〖30〗，回轨易途？舆安驾肆〖31〗，思马斯徂〖32〗？审厉揭以投济〖33〗，要夷庚之赫怃〖34〗？播秋兰以芳世，副吾徒之（彼）〔披〕图〖35〗：不亦盛与？’","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":384,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":551,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-896e9fc28382dc9000da","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-7be2576152dfd259a544","layer":"original","quote":"后进文士秘书郎郤正，数从光咨访。光问正太子所习读，并其情性好尚，正答曰：“奉亲虔恭〖15〗，夙夜匪懈〖16〗，有古世子之风〖17〗；接待群僚，举动出于仁恕。”光曰：“如君所道，皆家户所有耳。吾今所问，欲知其权略智调何如也","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":133,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-96b300155ce79a731924","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-a3a5b84b5802773e92ab","layer":"original","quote":"依则先儒〖1〗，假文现意〖2〗，号曰《释讥》；其文继于崔骃《达旨》","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":383,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-9bd7966e3bd0e5179d2e","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-08868d6c0d4b22a4e911","layer":"original","quote":"正曰：“世子之道，在于承志竭欢〖19〗，既不得妄有所施为；且智调藏于胸怀，权略应时而发。此之有无，焉可预设也？”光解正慎宜〖20〗，不为放谈〖21〗。乃曰：“吾好直言，无所回避，每弹射利病，为世人所讥嫌；（疑）省君意亦不甚好吾言〖22〗，然语有次〖23〗。今天下未定，智意为先；智意虽有自然〖24〗，然（不）〔亦〕可力强致也〖25〗。此储君读书〖26〗，宁当效吾等竭力博识以待访问〖27〗，如博士探策讲试以求爵位邪〖28〗？当务其急者！”正深谓光言为然","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":226,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-9c7792ad9c7693a5ec5b","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-a1e74576a6b7b38d1651","layer":"original","quote":"方今朝士山积〖21〗，髦俊成群；犹鳞介之潜乎巨海〖22〗，毛羽之集乎邓林〖23〗；游禽逝不为之鲜〖24〗，浮鲂臻不为之殷〖25〗。且阳灵幽于唐叶〖26〗，阴精应于商时〖27〗；阳盱请而洪灾息〖28〗，桑林祷而甘泽滋〖29〗。﹝二﹞行止有道，启塞有期。我师遗训，不怨不尤；委命恭己，我又何辞？","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":513,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":145,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-a062b6f53bf519cea4a2","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-4ab9a42c1dd0d6494977","layer":"original","quote":"咸宁四年卒","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":581,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":74,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-a3b847730fd0f1bef8ae","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-b5de5af217a91a36019e","layer":"original","quote":"正本名纂。少以父死母嫁，单茕只立〖4〗；而安贫好学，博览坟籍，弱冠能属文。入为秘书吏〖5〗。转为令史，迁郎〖6〗，至令〖7〗。","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":365,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-b1a2f1cbd7009ba5674c","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-c949dabd1d8133b98b1d","layer":"original","quote":"然吾不才，在朝累纪〖1〗；托身所天，心焉是恃；乐沧海之广深，叹嵩岳之高峙〖2〗；闻仲尼之赞商〖3〗，感乡校之益己〖4〗；彼平仲之和羹〖5〗，亦进可而替否〖6〗；故矇冒瞽说〖7〗，时有攸献；譬遒人之有采于市闾〖8〗，游童之吟咏乎疆畔〖9〗；庶以增广福祥，输力规谏。若其合也，则以暗协明〖10〗，进应灵符；如其违也，自我常分，退守己愚。进退任数〖11〗，不矫不诬〖12〗；循性乐天，夫何恨诸？此其所以既入不出，有而若无者也。","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":511,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":210,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-b38c15be11ef0af4a796","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-66c2abcad693efe21a5f","layer":"original","quote":"万事之精练也！’","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":386,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-bb3ed6b7335eee3e95e3","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-4ab9a42c1dd0d6494977","layer":"original","quote":"泰始八年诏曰：“正，昔在成都，颠沛守义，不违忠节；及见受用，尽心干事，有治理之绩。其以正为巴西太守","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":581,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-bba4e5b28f6ab6c4f591","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-2cc546b2b2e896733717","layer":"original","quote":"自我大汉，应天顺民；政治之隆，皓若阳春；俯宪坤典〖1〗，仰式乾文〖2〗；播皇泽以熙世〖3〗，扬茂化之醲醇〖4〗；君臣履度〖5〗，各守厥真。上垂询纳之弘，下有匡救之责；士无虚华之宠，民有一行之迹；粲乎亹亹〖6〗，尚此忠益。","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":470,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-fe39aeda0247f8516310","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-63b42641a680eadddce4","layer":"original","quote":"惟正及殿中督汝南张通，舍妻子单身随侍。后主赖正相导宜适〖3〗，举动无阙；乃慨然叹息，恨知正之晚","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":580,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":40,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q2-ac591ab893dbcebe554c","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-f1e0524442057229c3d8","layer":"original","quote":"后主犹疑于入南〖15〗，周上疏曰：“或说陛下以北兵深入，有欲适南之计，臣愚以为不安。何者？南方远夷之地，平常无所供为〖16〗，犹数反叛；自丞相亮南征，兵势逼之，穷乃（幸）〔率〕从〖17〗。是后供出官赋，取以给兵，以为愁怨：此患国之人也〖18〗。今以穷迫，欲往依恃，恐必复反叛。一也；北兵之来，非但取蜀而已；若奔南方，必因人势衰，及时赴追。二也；若至南方，外当拒敌，内供服御〖19〗，费用张广〖20〗；他无所取，耗损诸夷必甚，甚必速叛。三也；昔王郎以邯郸僭号〖21〗，时世祖在信都〖22〗，畏逼于郎，欲弃还关中。邳肜谏曰：‘明公西还，则邯郸城民不肯捐父母〖23〗，背城主，而千里送公；其亡叛可必也〖24〗。’世祖从之，遂破邯郸。今北兵至，陛下南行，诚恐邳肜之言复信于今。四也。愿陛下早为之图，可获爵土；若遂适南，势穷乃服，其祸必深。《易》曰：‘亢之为言〖25〗：知得，而不知丧〖26〗；知存，而不知亡。知得失、存亡而不失其正者，其惟圣人乎！’言圣人知命而不苟必也〖27〗。故尧、舜以子不善，知天有授〖28〗，而求授人〖29〗。子虽不肖〖30〗，祸尚未萌，而迎授与人，况祸已至乎？故微子以殷王之昆〖31〗，面缚衔璧而归武王〖32〗：岂所乐哉？不得已也！”","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":525,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q2-c132e85e5120f4160254","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-a3a5b84b5802773e92ab","layer":"original","quote":"依则先儒〖1〗，假文现意〖2〗，号曰《释讥》；其文继于崔骃《达旨》〖3〗，其辞曰：","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":383,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q2-da1d73b423afc5a0b695","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-4ab9a42c1dd0d6494977","layer":"original","quote":"泰始中，除安阳令〖4〗，迁巴西太守。﹝一﹞（泰始八年诏曰：“正，昔在成都，颠沛守义，不违忠节；及见受用，尽心干事，有治理之绩。其以正为巴西太守。”）咸宁四年卒。凡所著述诗论赋之属，垂百篇。","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":581,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"erfei-q-8683f8fdde33a5a39205","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-caa1bd390bc6a9f3db51","layer":"original","quote":"景耀六年冬，蜀亡","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-22dee006306dcfe238a7","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-53f50d8a3e0bf232cd15","layer":"original","quote":"永安六年，蜀并于魏","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-O077","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-083c24beaf11955596f3","layer":"original","quote":"冬，邓艾破卫将军诸葛瞻于绵竹。用光禄大夫谯周策〖8〗，降于艾。奉书曰：“限分江、汉〖9〗，遇值深远〖10〗，阶缘蜀土〖11〗，斗绝一隅〖12〗；干运犯冒〖13〗，渐苒历载〖14〗，遂与京畿攸隔万里〖15〗。每惟黄初中〖16〗，文皇帝命虎牙将军鲜于辅〖17〗，宣温密之诏〖18〗，申三好之恩〖19〗；开示门户〖20〗，大义炳然。而否德暗弱〖21〗，窃贪遗绪〖22〗；俯仰累纪〖23〗，未率大教〖24〗。天威既震〖25〗，人鬼归能（之数）〖26〗，怖骇王师；神武所次〖27〗，敢不革面〖28〗，顺以从命！辄敕群帅投戈释甲，官府帑藏一无所毁〖29〗。百姓布野，余粮栖亩〖30〗；以俟后来之惠〖31〗，全元元之命〖32〗。伏惟大魏，布德施化；宰辅伊、周〖33〗，含覆藏疾〖34〗。谨遣私署侍中张绍、光禄大夫谯周、驸马都尉邓良〖35〗，奉赍印绶〖36〗，请命告诚，敬输忠款；存亡敕赐，惟所裁之〖37〗。舆榇在近〖38〗，不复缕陈〖39〗。”","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":153,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":415,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-O079","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-fb6d39ea3e1279d8d1a7","layer":"original","quote":"绍、良与艾相遇于雒县。艾得书，大喜；即报书，﹝二﹞遣绍、良先还。艾至城北，后主舆榇自缚，诣军垒门〖40〗。艾解缚焚榇，延请相见；﹝三﹞因承制拜后主为骠骑将军。诸围守悉被后主敕〖41〗，然后降下〖42〗。艾使后主止其故宫，身往造焉〖43〗。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":155,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-O085","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-72cfc8a8795122c12087","layer":"original","quote":"食邑万户，赐绢万匹，奴婢百人，他物称是〖44〗；子孙为三都尉、封侯者五十余人〖45〗。尚书令樊建、侍中张绍、光禄大夫谯周、秘书令郤正、殿中督张通〖46〗，并封列侯。﹝一﹞","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-P081a","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-a8c3e37d5fbc72dc6b52","layer":"pei","quote":"后主将从谯周之策，北地主谌怒曰：‘若理穷力屈，祸败必及；便当父子君臣，背城一战，同死社稷，以见先帝可也！’后主不纳，遂送玺绶。","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5804c0b85b7b50186ffc","start":12,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-P082a","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-be1c6a77bfff424b4c56","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞王隐《蜀记》曰：“艾报书云：‘王纲失道，群英并起；龙战虎争，终归真主：此盖天命去就之道也。自古圣帝，爰逮汉、魏，受命而王者，莫不在乎中土。河出《图》，洛出《书》，圣人则之，以兴洪业；其不由此，未有不颠覆者也。隗嚣凭陇而亡，公孙述据蜀而灭：此皆前世覆车之鉴也。圣上明哲，宰相忠贤；将比隆黄轩，侔功往代。衔命来征，思闻嘉响；果烦来使，告以德音：此非人事，岂天启哉？昔微子归周，实为上宾；君子豹变，义存《大易》。来辞谦冲，以礼与舆榇，皆前哲归命之典也。全国为上，破国次之；自非通明智达，何以见王者之义乎！’禅又遣太常张峻、益州别驾汝超受节度，遣太仆蒋显有命敕姜维。又遣尚书郎李虎送士民簿，领户二十八万，男女口九十四万；带甲将士十万二千，吏四万人；米四十余万斛，金、银各二千斤，锦绮、彩绢各二十万匹，余物称此。”","attribution":"王隐《蜀记》","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9231f0793ae41fa221ac","start":0,"end":355,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-P087","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-0f5d56c1260bebd49f1f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“司马文王与禅宴，为之作故蜀伎；旁人皆为之感怆，而禅喜笑自若。王谓贾充曰：‘人之无情，乃可至于是乎！虽使诸葛亮在，不能辅之久全，而况姜维邪？’充曰：‘不如是，殿下何由并之？’他日，王问禅曰：‘颇思蜀否？’禅曰：‘此间乐，不思蜀。’郤正闻之，求见禅曰：‘若王后问，宜泣而答曰“先人坟墓，远在陇、蜀；乃心西悲，无日不思”，因闭其目。’会王复问，对如前；王曰：‘何乃似郤正语邪！’禅惊视曰：‘诚如尊命！’左右皆笑。”","attribution":"裴注·汉晋春秋","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-093b6d94cb8e41e60f73","start":0,"end":216,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-P087a","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-0f5d56c1260bebd49f1f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“司马文王与禅宴，为之作故蜀伎；旁人皆为之感怆，而禅喜笑自若。王谓贾充曰：‘人之无情，乃可至于是乎！虽使诸葛亮在，不能辅之久全，而况姜维邪？’充曰：‘不如是，殿下何由并之？’他日，王问禅曰：‘颇思蜀否？’禅曰：‘此间乐，不思蜀。’郤正闻之，求见禅曰：‘若王后问，宜泣而答曰“先人坟墓，远在陇、蜀；乃心西悲，无日不思”，因闭其目。’会王复问，对如前；王曰：‘何乃似郤正语邪！’禅惊视曰：‘诚如尊命！’左右皆笑。”","attribution":"裴注","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-093b6d94cb8e41e60f73","start":0,"end":216,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-c96785b0920fd4930364","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-8f0e683a3aca43ae9c4b","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，蜀并于魏。弋与巴东领军襄阳罗宪〖13〗，各保全一方，举以内附；咸因仍前任〖14〗，宠待有加","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0196","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-9de65e02e159a5ef52b1","layer":"original","quote":"后主请降于艾","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0208","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-a9fabec7a7e9f30d546c","layer":"original","quote":"郤正著论论维曰：“姜伯约据上将之重，处群臣之右；宅舍弊薄〖1〗，资财无余；侧室无妾媵之亵〖2〗，后庭无声乐之娱；衣服取供〖3〗，舆马取备；饮食节制，不奢不约〖4〗；官给费用，随手消尽。察其所以然者，非以激贪厉浊〖5〗，抑情自割也〖6〗；直谓如是为足〖7〗，不在多求。凡人之谈，常誉成毁败，扶高抑下；咸以姜维投厝无所〖8〗，身死宗灭，以是贬削〖9〗，不复料擿〖10〗：异乎《春秋》褒贬之义矣。如姜维之乐学不倦，清素节约，自一时之仪表也！”﹝一﹞","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":221,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0251","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-3c1c2f166f89cdf6271d","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞孙盛曰：“异哉郤氏之论也！夫士虽百行，操业万殊；至于忠孝义节，百行之冠冕也。姜维策名魏室，而外奔蜀朝，违君徇利，不可谓忠；捐亲苟免，不可谓孝；害加旧邦，不可谓义；败不死难，不可谓节；且德政未敷而疲民以逞，居御侮之任而致敌丧守，于夫智勇，莫可云也：凡斯六者，维无一焉。实有魏之逋臣，亡国之乱相；而云人之‘仪表’，斯亦惑矣。纵维好书而微自藻洁，岂异夫盗者分财之义，而程郑降阶之善也！”","attribution":"孙盛论","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4fd2b1107827b198b4fd","start":0,"end":193,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0252","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-ef7d470cc3553be43789","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：郤正此论，取其可称；不谓维始终行事，皆可准则也。所云“一时仪表”，止在好学与俭素耳。本传及《魏略》皆云，维本无叛心，以急逼归蜀。盛相讥贬，惟可责其背母；余既过苦，又非所以难郤正也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4fd2b1107827b198b4fd","start":0,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"major-proof-q-dengai","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-ab37cd18c6e8ebcec1ec","layer":"original","quote":"刘禅遣使奉皇帝玺绶，为笺诣艾请降。艾至成都，禅率太子、诸王及群臣六十余人，面缚舆榇诣军门〖1〗。艾执节，解缚焚榇，受而宥之。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":347,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"major-proof-q-houzhu","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-fb6d39ea3e1279d8d1a7","layer":"original","quote":"艾至城北，后主舆榇自缚，诣军垒门〖40〗。艾解缚焚榇，延请相见；","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":155,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"major-proof-q-shu-variant","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-48582bda3620c8e6db2a","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《晋诸公赞》曰：“刘禅乘骡车诣艾，不具亡国之礼。”","attribution":"《晋诸公赞》","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3cec51d46edadb4b2cd1","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o169a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-05f79fb18153dad67bec","layer":"original","quote":"自邓艾、钟会率众伐蜀，所至辄克。是月，蜀主刘禅诣艾降〖14〗，巴蜀皆平。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ef642248e44d01f3825d","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o165","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b35fdf03685051716720","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，复命大将军进位、爵赐，一如前诏。又固辞，乃止。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0050","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-ab37cd18c6e8ebcec1ec","layer":"original","quote":"刘禅遣使奉皇帝玺绶，为笺诣艾请降。艾至成都，禅率太子、诸王及群臣六十余人，面缚舆榇诣军门〖1〗。艾执节，解缚焚榇，受而宥之。检御将士，无所虏略；绥纳降附，使复旧业：蜀人称焉。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":347,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0385","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-ab37cd18c6e8ebcec1ec","layer":"original","quote":"刘禅遣使奉皇帝玺绶，为笺诣艾请降","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":347,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0386","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-ab37cd18c6e8ebcec1ec","layer":"original","quote":"艾至成都，禅率太子、诸王及群臣六十余人，面缚舆榇诣军门","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":347,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":17,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0387","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-ab37cd18c6e8ebcec1ec","layer":"original","quote":"艾执节，解缚焚榇，受而宥之。检御将士，无所虏略；绥纳降附，使复旧业：蜀人称焉","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":347,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":48,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode